#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kblackbox; is a nice logical game, inspired by the <application>emacs</"
"application> blackbox game. A major part of this help file is based on the "
"original <application>emacs</application> help."
msgstr ""
"&kblackbox; je prijatna logička igra, inspirisana <application>emacs</"
"application> blackbox igrom. Glavni dio ove pomoćne datoteke je baziran na "
"orginalnoj <application>emacs</application> pomoći."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kblackbox; is a game of hide and seek played on a grid of boxes. The "
"computer has hidden several balls within this box. By shooting beams into "
"the box and observing where they emerge it is possible to deduce the "
"positions of the hidden balls."
msgstr ""
"&kblackbox; je igra skrivača koja se igra na rešetki kutija. Kompjuter je "
"sakrio nekoliko loptica unutar ove kutije. Ispaljivanjem zrake u kutiju i "
"posmatranjem gdje će se pojaviti moguće je zaključiti poziciju skrivenih "
"loptica."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The fewer beams you use and the quicker you are to find the balls, the "
"better (the lower) your score."
msgstr ""
"Što manje zraka iskoristite i što ste brži u pronalasku loptica, to vam je "
"bolji (niži) rezultat."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to Play"
msgstr "Kako igrati"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "Objective:"
msgstr "Cilj:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use laser beams to deduce the placement of the balls inside the black box."
msgstr ""
"Koristite laserske zrake da bi ste zaključili položaj loptica unutar crne "
"kutije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use lasers and place balls and markers on the game board to deduce the "
"position of the hidden balls inside the black box."
msgstr ""
"Koristite lasere i postavljene loptice i oznake na igračkoj ploči za "
"utvrđivanje položaja skrivenih loptica unutar crne kutije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The game starts as soon as you use the first laser. Before that, the time is "
"not running and no point will be count for the score."
msgstr ""
"Igra počinje čim iskoristite prvi laser. Prije toga, vrijeme ne teče i "
"nijedan poen neće biti uračunat u rezultat."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The cursor can be moved around the box with the standard cursor movement "
"keys or the mouse. Switching of lasers or marking of black boxes is done "
"with the &LMB;, or by pressing the <keycap>Return</keycap> or &Enter; key."
msgstr ""
"Pokazivač može biti pomijeran oko kutije sa standardnim tipkama kretanja "
"pokazivača ili sa mišem. Prebacivanje lasera ili markiranje crnih kutija se "
"radi sa &LMB;, ili pritiskom na <keycap>Povratak</keycap> ili &Enter; tipku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can also drag and drop the balls and the markers with the mouse."
msgstr "Možete također povući i pustiti loptice i oznake mišem."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can mark the fields where you think a ball cannot be, too. Just press "
"the &RMB;. It often helps you to find an area where a ball could possibly "
"be. To clear any marks, press the same key or mouse button again."
msgstr ""
"Možete, također, označiti polja gdje mislite da nema loptice. Samo "
"pritisnite &RMB;. Često vam pomaže pronaći polje gdje loptica može biti. Za "
"brisanje bilo kojih oznaka, pritisnite opet  istu tipku ili dugme miša."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you think the configuration of balls you have placed is correct, press "
"the <guibutton>Done!</guibutton> button. You will be informed whether you "
"are correct or not, and be given your score."
msgstr ""
"Kad miliste da vam je konfiguracija loptica koje ste postavili tačna, "
"pritisnite <guibutton>Gotovo!</guibutton> dugme. Bit ćete informisani da li "
"je tačno ili ne, i biće vam dat vaš rezultat."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you placed any balls incorrectly, the right solution will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste smjestili neke loptice netačno, tačno rješenje će biti prikazano."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The score increases with the time (1 point per second) and with the use of "
"lasers: 3 points if the laser beam hits a ball or exits at the entry point "
"and 9 points if it exists at another entry point. If you make a mistake, the "
"score is set at the end of the game to 999, which is the maximum score."
msgstr ""
"Rezultat se povećava vremenom ( 1 poen po sekundi ) i sa korištenjem lasera: "
"3 poena ako laserski zrak pogodi lopticu ili izađe na ulaznoj tački i 9 "
"poena ako izađe na nekoj drugoj ulaznoj tački. Ako napravite grešku, "
"rezultat se na kraju igre postavlja na 999, što je maksimalni rezultat."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Rules, Strategies and Tips"
msgstr "Pravila igre, Strategije i savjeti"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Rules"
msgstr "Pravila Igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have to find balls hidden in the black box. Your means are limited - you "
"can just fire lasers which are around the box. There are three possible "
"outcomes for each beam you send into the box:"
msgstr ""
"Trebate naći loptice skrivene u crnoj kutiji. Vaši načini su ograničeni - "
"možete samo ispaljivati lasere koji su oko kutije. Postoje 3 moguća ishoda "
"za svaku zraku koju pošaljete u kutiju:"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Detour"
msgstr "Zaobilazak"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The beam is deflected and emerges somewhere other than where you sent it in. "
"On the playfield, detours are denoted by matching pairs of numbers - one "
"where the beam went in, and the other where it came out."
msgstr ""
"Zraka je skrenuta i pojavljuje se negdje drugo  nego gdje ste je vi poslali. "
"Na terenu, zaobilasci su označeni odgovarajućim parom brojeva - jedan gdje "
"je zrak ušao, i drugi gdje je izašao."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reflection"
msgstr "Odbijanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The beam is reflected and emerges in the same place it was sent in. On the "
"playfield, reflections are denoted by a special sign."
msgstr ""
"Zrak je reflektovan i pojavljuje se na istom mjestu sa kojeg je poslat. Na "
"terenu, refleksije se označavaju posebnim znakom."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Hit</term>"
msgstr "<term>Pogodak</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The beam strikes a ball and is absorbed. It does not emerge from the box. On "
"the playfield, hits are denoted by a special sign."
msgstr ""
"Zrak pogađa lopticu i absorbiran je. Ne izranja iz kutije. Na terenu, pogoci "
"su označeni posebnim znakom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The rules for how balls deflect beams are simple and are best shown by "
"example."
msgstr ""
"Pravila kako loptice skreću zrake su jednostavna i najbolje su prikazana "
"kroz primjer."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As a beam approaches a ball it is deflected ninety degrees. Beams can be "
"deflected multiple times. In the diagrams below, the dashes represent empty "
"box locations and the letter <guilabel>O</guilabel> represents a ball. The "
"entrance and exit points of each beam are marked with numbers as described "
"under <link linkend=\"detour\">Detour</link> above. Note that the entrance "
"and exit points are always interchangeable. <guilabel>*</guilabel> denotes "
"the path taken by the beam."
msgstr ""
"Kako zrak prilazi loptici otklanja se za devedeset stepeni. Zrake mogu biti "
"otklonjene više puta. U dijagramima ispod, crtice predstavljaju lokacije "
"prazne kutije i slovo <guilabel>O</guilabel> predstavlja lopticu. Ulazne i "
"izlazne tačke svake zrake su označene brojevima kao što je objašnjeno pod "
"<link linkend=\"detour\">Zaobilaženje</link> iznad. Primijetite da su ulazne "
"i izlazne tačke uvijek zamjenjive. <guilabel>*</guilabel> označava put zraka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note carefully the relative positions of the ball and the ninety degree "
"deflection it causes."
msgstr ""
"Primijetite pažljivo relativne pozicije loptice  i otklona od devedeset "
"stepeni koji stvara."

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"1\n"
"  - * - - - - - -         - - - - - - - -         - - - - - - - -       \n"
"  - * - - - - - -         - - - - - - - -         - - - - - - - -       \n"
"1 * * - - - - - -         - - - - - - - -         - O - - - - O -       \n"
"  - - O - - - - -         - - O - - - - -         - - * * * * - -\n"
