"  - - - - - - - -       R * * * * - - - -          - - - - - - - -\n"
"  - - - - - - - -         - - - - O - - -          - - - - - - - -"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the first example, the beam is deflected downwards by the upper ball, "
"then left by the lower ball, and finally retraces its path to its point of "
"origin. The second example is similar. The third example is a bit anomalous "
"but can be rationalized by realizing the beam never gets a chance to get "
"into the box. Alternatively, the beam can be thought of as being deflected "
"downwards and immediately emerging from the box."
msgstr ""
"U prvom primjeru, zrak je otklonjen na dole godnjom lopticom, onda lijevo "
"donjom lopticom, i konačno prati put do tačke nastanka. Drugi primjer je "
"sličan. Treći primjer je malo neprirodan ali može biti racionaliziran "
"shvatajući da zrak nikad ne dobija šansu za udar u kutiju. Alternativno, "
"zrak može biti smatran kao otklonjen na dole i odmah izaći iz kutije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid "A hit occurs when a beam runs straight into a ball:"
msgstr "Pogodak se događa kada zrak naleti direktno na lopticu:"

#. Tag: screen
